# ALLOWLIST: ignore everything, then opt code back in.
# This folder holds API keys (.env), licensed PropertyRadar/LandVision/PropStream
# exports, owner PII (names, phones, emails) in every CSV/XLSX/HTML output, and
# ~700MB of Street View photos. None of that belongs in git.
*
!*/

# --- code ---
!/*.py
!/combined_opportunity_scoring/*.py
!/business_opportunity_scoring/*.py
!/business_opportunity_scoring/requirements.txt
!/atherton_opportunity_scoring/*.py
!/PropScoreAI/functions/**

# --- docs / repo meta ---
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/BUSINESS_DATA_IDEAS.md
!/.env.example

# never, even if a rule above would match
.env
**/.env
**/__pycache__/
**/.wrangler/
wrangler.toml
